  "decisionHub": {
    "whatItIs": "Uniqode (formerly Beaconstac) is a QR code and digital business card platform for creating, branding, and tracking dynamic codes that bridge offline marketing to online experiences. Official pricing FAQ (researched 2026-08-17) states static QR codes are free and dynamic QR starts from about $9/mo with annual billing; plan cards are JS-rendered — confirm live tiers. Business+/enterprise features are custom. Digital cards have separate Team packaging (~$6/user/mo researched — confirm live).",
